{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>לא נאוה</b> — And it is desirable for a fool to have תענוג, and this corresponds to 'one who keeps understanding,' who finds good. And it is possible that the fool is a false witness." "<b>תענוג</b> — Its meaning is to enjoy oneself in the world." "<b>אף כי לעבד משול בשרים</b> — And over nobles it is not fitting."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:37.024786447Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}